Name: octave-blocks
Version: 0.2.1
Date: 2026-11-22
Author: Shannon Ruan
Maintainer: Shannon Ruan
Title: Visual block diagrams and simulation for GNU Octave
Description: Build continuous and discrete block diagrams, run ordinary
 Octave functions, inspect signals and export a supported C99 model subset.
 Includes a Qt editor, multirate simulation and conditional subsystems.
Categories: Simulation
Depends: octave (>= 11.3.0)
License: MIT
Url: https://github.com/ShannoonRuaaa/octave-blocks
Tracker: https://github.com/ShannoonRuaaa/octave-blocks/issues
SystemRequirements: Qt graphics for the editor; a C99 compiler for exported code
